// The power-up state of Vslav's 8080 (rk86_16/k580vm80a.v) for simulation: every register of the model
// that is X at time 0 is set to 0, as Quartus powers registers up (ALLOW_POWER_UP_DONT_CARE OFF). The list
// is every reg declared in the model (108 names, in declaration order). Use it at time 0 in an initial block
// of a testbench, with the instance path: `CPU16_ZERO(dut.cpu). Compile this file before the testbench.
